&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;–&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;–&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience in a platform, publisher, or multi-studio portfolio environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;–&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;–&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with community&amp;nbsp;programs, player advisory panels, or structured feedback programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;–&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;–&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience supporting major launches, beat calendars, or GTM community plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workato delivers enterprise infrastructure for the agentic era, redefining iPaaS and helping enterprises unify data, applications, processes, and AI into a single, governed platform. A leader in Enterprise MCP and trusted by 50% of the Fortune 500, Workato’s cloud-native architecture connects every application, data source, and process to power real-time orchestration at scale. With enterprise-grade security and continuous innovation at its core, Workato provides the trusted foundation for organizations to automate with confidence and operationalize AI across the business. To learn more, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.workato.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We are driven by &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;and looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary &lt;strong&gt;Regional Chief Strategic Architect &lt;/strong&gt;to serve as Workato&#39;s technical authority and strategic advisor to our most critical prospects, customers, and the broader market within their assigned region. The Chief Strategic Architect operates at the nexus of technical credibility, executive influence, and market thought leadership, acting as the external-facing voice of Workato&#39;s innovation and technical vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a sales role. It is a strategic, hybrid operator-advisor-influencer position. Chief Strategic Architects act as extensions of the executive team in the field, elevating conversations with senior leaders and positioning Workato as the essential platform for enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is accountable for building technical trust across the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through strategic expansion - while simultaneously shaping how the market understands enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation. The Chief Strategic Architect influences deal outcomes, product direction, and industry perception, ensuring Workato is recognized as the definitive leader in Enterprise Orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn &amp;amp; Align (Days 0-30)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep immersion into Workato&#39;s AI vision, product roadmap, and GTM strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shadow at least 10 executive customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop initial point of view for engagement with CIO/CTO/CDO personas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage &amp;amp; Formulate (Days 30-60)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead first strategic engagements with enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-develop executive playbooks with Sales and Product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish feedback loops with Product and Engineering teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Scale (Days 60-90)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate trusted relationships with C-level executives in 5+ strategic accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-create first AI-driven integration use cases with customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish thought leadership presence through content and speaking opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Trust &amp;amp; Executive Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage directly with C-level executives (CIOs, CTOs, Chief Data Officers, Chief AI Officers) at enterprise accounts to shape integration strategies that solve complex business challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as trusted technical advisor throughout the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through expansion - providing strategic guidance rooted in real-world operator experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build lasting peer-to-peer relationships that position you as the go-to expert on enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and automation at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as technical closer in competitive deals, articulating why Workato&#39;s architecture differentiates us from competitors like MuleSoft and Boomi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence enterprise architecture decisions and multi-year technology strategies at the executive level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Agentic Automation &amp;amp; Enterprise MCP Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape and guide customers&#39; AI and agentic automation journeys, leveraging Workato&#39;s AI capabilities and ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on the design and adoption of agent-based workflows, human-in-the-loop models, and decision automation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with customer executives to define enterprise MCP (Model Context Protocol) strategies including context management, secure AI orchestration, and governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate emerging AI capabilities into practical, scalable enterprise use cases that drive measurable business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position Workato as the integration and orchestration backbone for enterprise AI transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise &amp;amp; Thought Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish yourself as the recognized authority across iPaaS, API Management (APIM), data orchestration, EDI, and AI/Agentic automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead &quot;Art of the Possible&quot; workshops that fundamentally shift how customers think about enterprise integration and intelligent automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Workato at industry conferences, customer advisory boards, analyst briefings, and partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create high-impact thought leadership content: blogs, white papers, webinars, reference architectures, and technical videos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape industry narratives and best practices that establish Workato as the category leader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Acceleration &amp;amp; Commercial Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accelerate deal velocity through technical validation, competitive differentiation, and executive trust-building&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and shape strategic expansion opportunities by uncovering automation, integration, and AI-driven transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Sales Leadership on account strategy, competitive positioning, and C-level engagement tactics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Articulate compelling ROI narratives and business case frameworks that accelerate buying decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate measurable impact on win rates, deal size, and sales cycle length in strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory &amp;amp; Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead high-impact customer engagements requiring executive-level judgment, architectural vision, and industry expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide prospects and customers through Enterprise Orchestration vision and roadmap development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop prioritization frameworks for integration, automation, and AI use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technology evaluation and vendor selection processes with enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design governance, scalability, and enterprise operating models for automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Influence &amp;amp; Market Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the voice of the customer to Product and Engineering teams, channeling field insights into actionable roadmap input&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify capability gaps, competitive threats, and market opportunities based on executive-level customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and refine competitive positioning, objection handling, and differentiation strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define reusable patterns, reference architectures, and technical frameworks that accelerate customer success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence industry analysts and thought leaders to strengthen Workato&#39;s market position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Enablement &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Educate and enable Sales Engineers, Account Executives, and Customer Success teams on complex technical capabilities and emerging trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop strategic frameworks, competitive positioning, and executive engagement playbooks for enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor technical team members, helping them develop deeper domain expertise and executive engagement skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create scalable technical enablement content and programs that amplify your expertise across the field organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive customer reference creation and participation in case studies, speaking opportunities, and advisory boards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;20+ years of technology transformation experience, including integration, middleware, or API management platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15+ years in an Enterprise Architect, CTO, VP Engineering, or similar senior architecture/leadership role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience advising C-level executives on technology strategy and enterprise transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise security, governance, and operating models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of driving platform expansion and value realization in enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent executive communication skills, including board-level presentations and strategic documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to operate independently in complex, ambiguous environments and take ownership of outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel to client sites up to 50%, with flexibility based on regional needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills / Personal Characteristics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Business, or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of key enterprise applications: Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday, ServiceNow, SAP, Oracle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud platforms: AWS, Azure, and GCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with AI/ML platforms and agentic automation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a high-growth startup or scale-up environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established personal brand and thought leadership presence in the integration/automation space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Long-term success for this leader will be measured by their ability to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embed Workato at the heart of technology strategy conversations across the region&#39;s most influential enterprises&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate sustained engagement with senior technology and engineering leaders ensuring Workato becomes synonymous with Enterprise Orchestration and AI orchestration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a robust pipeline of seven-figure opportunities tied to transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reframe Workato in the minds of decision-makers and analysts as the essential platform for AI-enabled enterprise integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leave behind scalable playbooks and repeatable narratives that enable go-to-market teams to engage enterprise audiences with authority and credibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Req ID: 2646&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Capital on Tap 👋&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💳 Capital on Tap started because small businesses were underserved. Big banks were slow, their products weren&#39;t fit for purpose, and small business owners often couldn&#39;t access what they needed. We set out to fix that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Today we&#39;re a financial platform - not just a credit card company. We offer a best-in-class business credit card, SME-focused spend management platform, a savings product that hit £1 billion in funds within its first year, and a growing suite of tools and financial products that make running a small business easier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;1,000+ employees, £20bn in annual card spend, 200,000+ customers, 17,000+ Trustpilot reviews averaging 4.7 stars, and we&#39;re profitable. We’ve done a pretty good job so far, but we’re just getting started!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We empower you to be innovative and solve complex problems. This is a leadership role where you will have immediate ability (and expectation) to take ownership and make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🏡🏢This role is based in our Moorgate (London) office. You will be in the office at least 3 days per week, preferably 4, and will need to occasionally travel to our offices across Brighton, Cardiff, and Manchester.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People at Capital on Tap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The People function at Capital on Tap covers People, Talent, and People Ops, and this role reports directly to our CEO. It sits at the heart of our biggest bet: that talent density and an AI-first operating model are what take us from 200,000 customers to 1 million. Your job is to raise the talent level across the business, build the capability to consistently attract and land exceptional people, and help lead our shift to an AI-first organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your mandate is talent density, organisational design, and shaping our unique culture as we shift to an AI-first operating model. You will report directly to our CEO, sit on the Leadership Team, and lead the People, Talent, and People Ops teams. What you will be owning:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Density: &lt;/strong&gt;leading our company efforts to attract and land top-tier talent, building our employer brand, driving exceptional performance across teams, and ensuring we have A-players across all of our key roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerating AI:&lt;/strong&gt; helping drive our organisational efforts to embed AI systems and tools across every team in our business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving excellence in your teams: &lt;/strong&gt;building and driving our People, Talent, and People Ops teams to build the most talent dense business in the UK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisational Design:&lt;/strong&gt; architecting our people structure and team design around business outcomes in an AI first world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values: &lt;/strong&gt;stewardship of our company culture and values, ensuring they remain the bedrock of the organisation as we scale and evolve with new technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For 🔎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Leadership experience at fast-growing and scaled businesses, with experience running a People/HR function or having it report into you.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A proven track record of raising talent density: attracting exceptional people, stretching high performers, and exiting underperformers quickly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong commercial acumen, someone who runs People like a business function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A strong point of view on how to maintain a high-performance culture and strong values in an AI-first organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Some experience outside of the People function, whether operational, commercial, or general management is a bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt; 🌈&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We welcome, consider and encourage applications from anyone who shares our commitment to inclusivity. Join us in creating a space where authenticity thrives, and everyone can do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great Work Deserves Great Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We try not to take ourselves too seriously (all the time) so we make sure our office is decked out with a pool table, arcade machine, beer tap, and a couple of office dogs thrown in for good measure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Check out our benefits:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🏥 Private Healthcare including dental and opticians services through Vitality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;✈️ Worldwide travel insurance through Vitality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;❤️ Access to a women&#39;s health platform via Hertility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🎁 Anniversary Rewards (£250, £500, £750, 4-week fully paid sabbatical)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;👛 Salary Sacrifice Pension Scheme up to 7% match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🏖️ 28 days holiday (plus bank holidays)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;📖 Annual Learning and Wellbeing Budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;👪 Enhanced Parental Leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🚲 Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🚂 Season Ticket Loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;💬 6 free therapy sessions per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🐶 Dog Friendly Offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🍫 Free drinks and snacks in our offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Check out more of our benefits, values and mission&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capitalontap.com/en/company/careers/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Other Info&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;👍Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capitalontap.com/en/blog/posts/acing-your-interviews-with-capital-on-tap/&quot;&gt;‘Top Tips’ for interviewing.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;✔️Keep updated on new job opportunities by following us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/capital-on-tap&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;📧Email &lt;a ---------- if you have any questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited to work here? Apply!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’d like to progress your career within our fast growing, profitable fintech then click apply and we will aim to get back to you within 3 working days (during busy periods this could take up to 5 working days.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Tax Analyst will join a world-class finance operation to support the daily operations of our global tax function, promoting continuous improvement and high performance. In this role, you will complete critical domestic and international tax initiatives required to support dynamic growth and scale. We are seeking an exceptional teammate with a learning and growth mindset who challenges the status quo to improve processes. You will thrive in a fast-paced environment while driving impact through quantitative problem-solving and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare global direct and indirect tax filings while collaborating with outside service providers on sales, use, business, and digital service taxes across various jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of income tax provisions, including standard calculations, tax account roll-forward schedules, and return-to-provision analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cross-department tax projections, model income tax scenarios, and conduct strategic research for business initiatives and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key areas of improvement throughout the tax compliance process to develop and execute actionable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare monthly General Ledger account reconciliations and communicate required journal entries for direct and indirect tax accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure indirect taxes are accurately collected by maintaining global product taxability and exemption certificates, while also supporting tax audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Public Accounting or an in-house tax department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience in tax, accounting, finance, economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of global direct and indirect tax frameworks and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to produce timely deliverables and manage shifting priorities in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration and communication skills to coordinate with various internal and external groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of identifying process improvements and executing action plans with high attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience researching strategic tax opportunities, risks, and compliance projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical mindset with a strong affinity for quantitative problem-solving and financial modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven approach with a high level of integrity and professional standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 weeks paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on your career growth:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection and life assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program - including 24/7 GP &amp;amp; free legal advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike2Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season ticket loan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events &amp;amp; Thursday happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch 2 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best connections happen face-to-face, whether you’re sitting down to dinner or having coffee with a coworker. That’s why OpenTable has adopted a hybrid workplace model. This role aligns with that approach, with an expectation of coming into the office two days a week—giving employees the best of both worlds: in-person collaboration and flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive (Warrington)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote (with Travel around North West UK Territory)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive in the North West of th UK, you will drive the expansion of our dining network by acquiring new restaurant partners through a consultative sales approach. You will act as a trusted advisor to top restaurants, demonstrating how our industry-leading front-of-house management and online reservation technology can optimize their revenue potential. In this remote position with up to 60% domestic travel, you will play a crucial role in empowering restaurants to focus on their teams and guests. Your strategic efforts will directly influence our market presence and the continued success of the hospitality industry in your territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, target, and approach prospective restaurant customers within your assigned territory to drive revenue and consistently exceed acquisition targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and maintain strong relationships with elite restaurant partners, acting as a strategic consultant to challenge their business perspectives and offer industry insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-quality, customized, data-driven demonstrations of our solutions in person and online to address specific partner needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop comprehensive business plans to define selling strategies, overcome competitive objections, and drive long-term business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilise Salesforce effectively to manage your territory, forecast sales activity, process contracts, and stay organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and present valuable customer feedback to product and marketing teams while maintaining visibility in the hospitality industry through networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in business-to-business (B2B) enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive with a full UK driving license and access to a car&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of goal-oriented sales performance, including outbound lead generation and pipeline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with CRM software (such as Salesforce) and Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in a remote environment with up to 60% domestic travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior sales experience within the food and beverage industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to leverage data and analytics to inform strategic decision-making and build compelling business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional time management, discovery, and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly collaborative, team-oriented mindset with a passion for continuous learning and&lt;br&gt;hospitality technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
