&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll support the Campaign and Partner Marketing team across our DE, UK, FR, and ES markets in executing marketing campaigns for our cloud products and services, gaining hands-on insight into how our marketing department collaborates internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of presentations, marketing, and sales materials, as well as the planning, execution, and evaluation of marketing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the planning and on-site coordination of marketing events and partner sponsorships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support partner and channel marketing activities, including MDF (Marketing Development Funds) processes and partner campaign coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and support the team with internal purchasing/procurement processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational support for campaign management, including lead imports, campaign tracking, and preparing data for regular reporting (e.g., weekly performance reports across markets).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build campaign landing pages using our CMS system (Typo3).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrolled student in Business Administration, Digital Marketing, Marketing Communications, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicative team player with strong analytical thinking and a hands-on mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First practical experience (e.g., through prior internships or working student roles) is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with content management systems (CMS) and experience creating or maintaining web content is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High degree of commitment, initiative, and strong organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in current marketing trends as well as cloud and AI-related technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Skills: Fluent German and very good English (spoken and written).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidized canteen and various free drinks at select locations.&lt;/li&gt;
