&lt;p&gt;Berlin / Hamburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic and experienced Resource Manager to join our EMEA resourcing team for our Experience &amp;amp; Engineering DACH Team (Across Germany and Switzerland). This role is essential in ensuring efficient resource allocation, optimizing utilization, and aligning with business growth in a fast-paced digital environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for matching the right talent to the right projects - balancing team skills, availability, and project needs to deliver high-quality work, on time and on budget. This includes managing billable headcount, supporting dynamic staffing needs, and planning ahead with the Commercial team to align with the business pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of digital project delivery (e.g., websites, e-commerce, mobile apps) and the roles involved - such as UX/UI Design,Strategy, Engineers, QA, Devops, among others.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone with excellent people skills, an analytical mindset, and a proactive approach to team planning - someone who can help us operate with agility, elevate our talent, and support impactful client work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you’ll work in a creative, fast-moving environment alongside brilliant minds, for a wide range of global clients. We value curiosity, growth, and a drive to make a positive impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Planning &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the full resourcing lifecycle across Experience &amp;amp; Engineering requests for a pool of ~100 FTE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate capacity, utilization, and bandwidth to optimize allocation, balancing business needs with team wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make strategic resourcing decisions considering project margins, business priorities, and talent development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand Forecasting &amp;amp; Workforce Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Delivery, Finance and Operation during project intake to build effective staffing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain accurate short- and long-term demand forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify skill gaps and workforce needs, partnering with Craft Leads and People &amp;amp; Culture on hiring and training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Regional Resourcing &amp;amp; External Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate resourcing across EMEA, including nearshore and offshore teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and onboard freelancers or external partners when internal capacity is unavailable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a balanced approach between internal, nearshore/offshore, and freelance resourcing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key partner to Delivery, Sales, Operations, Project Managers, and Craft Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between resourcing strategies and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a consultative approach by advising on alternative profiles or staffing solutions based on project needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Conflict Resolution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks in resourcing plans and implement mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and resolve resource conflicts, competing priorities, and overlapping demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting, Data &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high data quality within resource management tools (e.g., Resource Guru)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with processes such as time tracking, allocations, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on key metrics (utilization, capacity, bench, freelance/nearshore ratios)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular insights to local, regional, and global leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;ll BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Resource Management, Engineering Resource Management, or Technical/Digital Project Management within a digital agency or product environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple markets and cultures (EMEA experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital &amp;amp; Technical Understanding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of digital roles (Backend, Frontend, DevOps, QA, Business Analysis, UX/UI, Project Management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of digital product delivery (web, e-commerce, mobile) and cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate project needs into effective staffing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and forecasting skills, with experience in reporting tools such as Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in resource management tools (Resource Guru experience is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to influence across teams and seniority levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and acting as a trusted advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with strong problem-solving and decision-making abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and process-driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to prioritize effectively in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, solution-oriented, and comfortable navigating complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, team-oriented, and hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, adaptable, and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, assertive and clear communication skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;ll GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working policy (1-2 days at the office, depending on location);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 personal monthly allowance via our dedicated benefits apps for use across daily expenses and lifestyle perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lease bike options / JobRad and 25% subsidy for the Deutschlandticket.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional breakfast/lunch at the office, Smoothie Tuesdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Bens - Exclusive access to sustainable, healthy products at attractive deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the global leader in Process Intelligence and the pioneer of Process Mining technology. As one of the world’s fastest-growing enterprise SaaS companies, we are changemakers pushing the boundaries of what’s possible. We invest heavily in advanced AI capabilities—specifically our Process Intelligence Graph—to turn data insights into immediate business action. We believe there is a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by placing intelligence at the core of every business process. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Celonis Context Model&lt;/strong&gt; provides a real-time digital twin of enterprise operations, serving as the bridge between enterprise systems and AI. It captures how business actually flows across systems, giving organizations and AI agents the context needed to optimize complex workflows in real time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an engineer on the Context Model Core team, you will shape the foundation powering the future of Enterprise AI and Process Intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for a Full Stack Engineer to build the core capabilities to power the Celonis Context Model. In this role, you will build the next generation of user-facing tools and robust backend services that define how the world’s largest enterprises understand their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will tackle full-stack engineering challenges end-to-end: from designing scalable microservices in &lt;strong&gt;Java (Spring Boot)&lt;/strong&gt; to building rich, interactive UI components in &lt;strong&gt;Angular and TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll work closely with product and design to turn abstract data modeling into fast, reliable and joyful user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work at Celonis will directly impact companies and people around the globe as they improve their processes to save money, reduce waste, improve automation and generally become more efficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, articulate and drive the execution of the technical vision and strategy for the entire product area, securing necessary buy-in from stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on, leading the development of complex, critical-path components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving application performance improvement for big data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an active role in product discussions to shape roadmaps, ensuring technical feasibility aligns with business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set an example for technical excellence through rigorous design reviews, setting high coding standards, and taking action to improve developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow teammates while helping to define a fun and inclusive engineering culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The product you’ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the next generation of process mining by developing core platform capabilities that power the Celonis Context Model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable customers to model business processes as they operate in reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add semantic meaning to business data and make it efficiently queryable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AI/ML teams to simplify and accelerate context modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable connected, enterprise-wide process insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you’ll typically need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product development experience with strong track record of technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in architecting complex, distributed systems with large-scale data performance challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in consistently delivering high-quality output and elevating the performance and quality standards of the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take vague product requirements and turn them into concrete, executable technical roadmaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to gather alignment among diverse stakeholders and explain complex technical concepts to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred experience:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Angular TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis makes processes work — for people, companies, and the planet. Powered by process mining and AI, the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform integrates process data and business context to create a living digital twin of business operations. We enable thousands of companies worldwide to understand how their business actually runs and, together with their partners, build intelligent solutions that transform and continuously improve the way they operate — unlocking billions in value. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a href=&quot;https://academy.celonis.com/learn/video/discover-the-ems&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the global leader in Process Intelligence and the pioneer of Process Mining technology. As one of the world’s fastest-growing enterprise SaaS companies, we are changemakers pushing the boundaries of what’s possible. We invest heavily in advanced AI capabilities—specifically our Process Intelligence Graph—to turn data insights into immediate business action. We believe there is a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by placing intelligence at the core of every business process. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Process Mining Innovation (PMI) team is a dynamic group of R&amp;amp;D engineers committed to advancing process mining. We focus on hands-on development, creating new solutions and algorithms to continually elevate our platform and push the limits of best-in-class process mining technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Join the Process Mining Technology division as a Software Engineer for Process Mining Innovation. The division is focused on developing and testing cutting-edge algorithms and approaches for process discovery and data-driven process modeling. In this role, you will specialize in Object-Centric Process Mining (OCPM), a novel, multidimensional approach that is defining the future of process mining. Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translating requirements and innovative ideas into functional code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorously evaluating the efficacy and performance of the developed code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and integrating solutions into our existing product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating closely with product managers and other software engineers to ensure successful deployment to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to contribute to the scientific community and our intellectual property portfolio by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publishing your research results in top-tier scientific outlets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patent your inventive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in coordinating (funded) research projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Process Mining (PMI) team to understand the current state-of-the-art in Object-Centric Process Mining (OCPM) and identify valuable new solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and influence the development of OCPM features at Celonis by collaborating with platform product managers and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the optimal user experience by working closely with the UX team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate innovative ideas and requirements into high-quality, functional code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous evaluation of the developed code&#39;s efficacy and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and integrate new solutions into the existing product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers and fellow software engineers to ensure successful deployment to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publish research findings in top-tier scientific outlets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patent inventive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in coordinating funded research projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Mathematics, Business Informatics, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Process Mining, Data Analytics, or Business Intelligence tools (e.g., PowerBI, Tableau, Qlik).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial experience in programming, working with databases, and ETL processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, coupled with an interest in engaging with potential customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent spoken and written English is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and demonstrate &#39;out-of-the-box&#39; thinking are key personal traits sought for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial/Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SAP, Oracle, or other ERP systems is advantageous.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis makes processes work — for people, companies, and the planet. Powered by process mining and AI, the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform integrates process data and business context to create a living digital twin of business operations. We enable thousands of companies worldwide to understand how their business actually runs and, together with their partners, build intelligent solutions that transform and continuously improve the way they operate — unlocking billions in value. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a href=&quot;https://academy.celonis.com/learn/video/discover-the-ems&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
