&lt;p&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To all recruitment agencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligent does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Diligent employees or any other organization location. Diligent is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes.&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

